// Moves for B07, Castellan Voss, the Overfit Warden (registry 36100-36199). Source:
// docs/game/05-enemies-and-bosses.md, "B07 Castellan Voss, the Overfit Warden". Phase 1: a
// greatsword combo (the third cut delayed), a dagger off-hand stab, a guard stance with a counter,
// and a leaping slam. Phase 2 ("overfit") adds six counters, of which the two for his most-counted
// player actions are enabled (`ai::bosses::b07`): wide sweeps toward the favored roll side, a
// lunge against rolling back, a delayed swing against parrying, a guard-break kick against
// guarding, and a closing dash against ranged play. Damage comes from the body's `attack`, so
// `motion_value` is the only multiplier. Every attack telegraphs for at least 12 frames, only a
// combo's second or later hit is delayed, every combo ends in at least 20 frames of recovery, and
// the one Unblockable hit has a "flash_unblockable" vfx before it (all checked by
// `lf_content::boss::check`). Hit and frame numbers are tuning. The renderer matches choreography
// on words in `anim` (voss_*).
#![enable(implicit_some)]
[
  (
    // Greatsword combo, first cut: a rising diagonal chop. 20 frames of wind-up (the blade goes
    // back over his shoulder), then it comes through. Parry it or roll the line.
